<title>PORTUGAL: EDP, Transgas, GDP-Gas form telecoms consortium.</title>
<headline>EDP, Transgas, GDP-Gas form telecoms consortium.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese state energy company EDP-Electricidade de Portugal and gas companies Transgas and GDP-Gas de Portugal plan to form a consortium to study their entry to the telecommunications business, EDP said.  </p>
<p>&quot;EDP, Transgas and GDP-Gas de Portugal will form a consortium which aims to pursue technical and economic studies into the entry of the firms into the telecommunications business,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>It said the three companies would sign a protocol in Lisbon on Friday to establish the consortium.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
